    "updated_at": "2023-02-25T23:16:25Z",
    "body": "I think it would really be better to have an explicit list for this. [`<composite-mode>`](https://drafts.fxtf.org/compositing/#compositemode) includes \"plus-darker\" and \"plus-lighter\", which isn't supported by Firefox or Chrome (I haven't checked Webkit)",
