    "created_at": "2023-02-27T14:21:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-02-27T14:21:17Z",
    "body": "Generally we've tried to align 2D canvas with CSS (and SVG). So that is what we should do here as well.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure how much I trust upstream to do a good job of also updating the 2D canvas tests though whenever they add new values. Not sure how to best approach that.",
